</div><div class="html-p">To provide more details, the process of machine learning classification using the air quality dataset recorded in ThingSpeak can be broken down into several steps, as illustrated in <a href="https://www.mdpi.com/2624-6511/6/3/71#fig_body_display_smartcities-06-00071-f005" class="html-fig html-figpopup">Figure 5</a>. Firstly, the air quality dataset (i.e., the training dataset) is preprocessed to remove any missing or irrelevant data, and to transform the data into a suitable format for the machine learning models.</div><div class="html-fig-wrap" id="smartcities-06-00071-f005" data-position="float">
