      <a class="html-expand html-figpopup" data-counterslinkmanual="https://www.mdpi.com/2624-6511/6/3/71/display" href="https://www.mdpi.com/2624-6511/6/3/71#fig_body_display_smartcities-06-00071-f005"></a>
