                    <a href="mailto:?&amp;subject=From%20MDPI%3A%20%22IoT-Based%20Waste%20Segregation%20with%20Location%20Tracking%20and%20Air%20Quality%20Monitoring%20for%20Smart%20Cities%22&amp;body=https://www.mdpi.com/2314530%3A%0A%0AIoT-Based%20Waste%20Segregation%20with%20Location%20Tracking%20and%20Air%20Quality%20Monitoring%20for%20Smart%20CitiesMassive%20human%20population%2C%20coupled%20with%20rapid%20urbanization%2C%20results%20in%20a%20substantial%20amount%20of%20garbage%20that%20requires%20daily%20collection.%20In%20urban%20areas%2C%20garbage%20often%20accumulates%20around%20dustbins%20without%20proper%20disposal%20at%20regular%20intervals%2C%20creating%20an%20unsanitary%20environment%20for%20humans%2C%20plants%2C%20and%20animals.%20This%20situation%20significantly%20degrades%20the%20environment.%20To%20address%20this%20problem%2C%20a%20Smart%20Waste%20Management%20System%20is%20introduced%20in%20this%20paper%2C%20employing%20machine%20learning%20techniques%20for%20air%20quality%20level%20classification.%20Furthermore%2C%20this%20system%20safeguards%20garbage%20collectors%20from%20severe%20health%20issues%20caused%20by%20inhaling%20harmful%20gases%20emitted%20from%20the%20waste.%20The%20proposed%20system%20not%20only%20proves%20cost-effective%20but%20also%20enhances%20waste%20management%20productivity%20by%20categorizing%20waste%20into%20three%20types%3A%20wet%2C%20dry%2C%20and%20metallic.%20Ultimately%2C%20by%20leveraging%20machine%20learning%20techniques%2C%20we%20can%20classify%20air%20quality%20levels%20and%20garbage%20weight%20into%20distinct%20categories.%20This%20system%20is%20beneficial%20for%20improving%20the%20well-being%20of%20individuals%20residing%20in%20close%20proximity%20to%20dustbins%2C%20as%20it%20enables%20constant%20monitoring%20and%20reporting%20of%20air%20quality%20to%20relevant%20city%20authorities." title="Email">
